config BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_SUMMIT_KEY_PROVIDER
	bool "host summit-key-provider"
	default y
	help
	  Secure-boot signing key provider.  Materializes the signing
	  keys directory (KEYS_DIR) at build time from the local platform
	  key material and, for Cloud HSM (PKCS#11) builds, overlays key
	  wrappers and certificates.  For i.MX8M HAB it also stages the
	  SIG_DATA_PATH tree consumed by U-Boot's binman.

	  U-Boot and the TI K3 R5 loader depend on this package, so the
	  keys are in place before any signing step.  Materialization runs
	  once; changing the signing keys or Cloud HSM ARNs requires a
	  manual rebuild:

	    make host-summit-key-provider-rebuild uboot-rebuild \
	         ti-k3-r5-loader-rebuild
